{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a New “Us vs. Them” Comparison Section
    
    Create a clean, responsive comparison section for the Calm Nights product page.
    
    Heading
    
    ONE FORMULA. NOT A WHOLE SLEEP STACK.
    
    Supporting text
    
    A complete nightly formula for around $0.99 a night.
    
    Keep the heading centered, bold, and easy to scan. Use black for most of the heading and Ariya purple #7D45C6 to highlight “ONE FORMULA.”
    
    Comparison Table
    
    Create a two-column comparison table.
    
    Left column heading
    
    Calm Nights
    
    Right column heading
    
    Gummies & Stacks
    
    Use exactly these comparison rows:
    
    Calm Nights	Gummies & Stacks
    One nightly formula	A stack to juggle
    ~$0.99 a night	Costs pile up
    Full active doses	Mostly filler
    Disclosed, standardized	Proprietary blends
    Melatonin-free, no fog	Melatonin grogginess
    
    Do not rewrite, lengthen, or add to the comparison copy.
    
    Design Requirements
    Calm Nights side
    Use Ariya purple #7D45C6 for the column heading.
    Use white text inside the purple heading.
    Place a simple checkmark before each benefit.
    Use purple or dark green checkmarks.
    Use a white or very light lavender background for the rows.
    Make this side feel clean, premium, and positive.
    Gummies & Stacks side
    Use a soft gray or very pale red heading background.
    Use a simple X symbol before each comparison point.
    Use muted red X symbols.
    Use a very light gray or pale red background for the rows.
    Do not use bright or aggressive red.
    Keep the text dark and readable.
    Table styling
    Give the entire table softly rounded corners.
    Use thin, subtle divider lines between each row.
    Keep both columns equal width.
    Center-align the column headings.
    Vertically center the copy within every row.
    Keep the table compact and easy to scan.
    Do not use excessive shadows.
    Do not use large amounts of empty space.
    Keep the design consistent with the Ariya website.
    Mobile Requirements
    
    Keep the comparison in two columns on mobile.
    
    Do not stack one column underneath the other.
    Use smaller mobile font sizes so both sides remain readable.
    Keep each row aligned across both columns.
    Allow text to wrap naturally when needed.
    Keep the checkmark or X aligned beside the text.
    Use compact mobile padding.
    Make sure the table does not overflow the screen.
    Keep the heading and supporting text centered.
    
    Recommended mobile sizes:
    
    Section heading: 28–32px
    Supporting text: 15–17px
    Column headings: 15–17px
    Comparison text: 13–15px
    Row padding: 14–18px
    Side padding: 16–20px
    Desktop Requirements
    Set a maximum section width of approximately 900–1000px.
    Keep the comparison centered.
    Use comfortable spacing without making the section oversized.
    Increase the row text slightly on desktop.
    Keep both columns exactly aligned.
    Customization Settings
    
    Add editable settings for:
    
    Section heading
    Highlighted heading text
    Supporting text
    Left column heading
    Right column heading
    Every comparison row
    Left heading background color
    Right heading background color
    Left row background color
    Right row background color
    Checkmark color
    X color
    Heading size on desktop
    Heading size on mobile
    Comparison text size on desktop
    Comparison text size on mobile
    Row padding
    Column spacing
    Border radius
    Divider color
    Top padding
    Bottom padding
    Side padding
    Maximum desktop width
    
    The finished section should feel clean, premium, persuasive, and immediately understandable on both desktop and mobile., Redesign the new comparison section so it looks cleaner, wider, and more balanced on mobile.
    
    Do not create another section. Adjust the current “One Formula. Not a Whole Sleep Stack.” section only.
    
    Heading
    
    Change the heading to:
    
    ONE FORMULA.
    NO SLEEP STACK NEEDED.
    
    Styling:
    
    Center-align the heading.
    Use Ariya purple #7D45C6 for “ONE FORMULA.”
    Use black for “NO SLEEP STACK NEEDED.”
    Make the heading smaller so it does not overpower the comparison table.
    Keep it to exactly two lines on mobile.
    
    Underneath, use:
    
    A complete nightly formula in just two capsules for $0.99 a night.
    
    Keep the subtitle centered, smaller, and limited to two lines.
    
    Comparison table
    
    Make the table nearly full width on mobile with approximately 16–20px of side margin.
    
    Use two equal-width columns:
    
    Left heading: Calm Nights
    Right heading: Typical Sleep Stack
    
    Use Ariya purple for the Calm Nights heading background.
    
    Use a soft light gray or very pale lavender for the Typical Sleep Stack heading. Do not use a dark or harsh competitor color.
    
    Use these five comparison rows:
    
    Calm Nights	Typical Sleep Stack
    One complete formula	Multiple products to manage
    Just $0.99 a night	Costs add up
    Only 2 capsules	Multiple pills, powders, or gummies
    Fully disclosed doses	Doses may be unclear
    Melatonin-free	Often relies on melatonin
    Mobile formatting
    Increase the width of the table.
    Reduce the font size slightly so the text fits naturally.
    Keep each phrase to approximately one or two lines.
    Left-align the text inside each cell.
    Vertically center the text in every row.
    Use consistent row heights.
    Use purple checkmarks on the Calm Nights side.
    Use muted red or gray X icons on the Typical Sleep Stack side.
    Use thin, subtle dividing lines.
    Use rounded outer corners.
    Remove the heavy drop shadow.
    Keep the design compact without making the text difficult to read.
    Important
    Do not use “Mostly filler.”
    Do not use “Full active doses.”
    Do not use “Melatonin grogginess.”
    Do not use the heading “Gummies & Stacks.”
    Do not make the heading larger than the table.
    Do not make the section narrow and centered inside excessive white space.
    
    Remove or hide the old “Us vs. Them” section underneath this new comparison so the comparison does not appear twice.
    
    The final design should feel clean, premium, credible, and easy to scan on mobile.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-comparison-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.padding_side }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-comparison-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-heading-line1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    color: {{ block.settings.highlight_color }};
  }

  .ai-comparison-heading-line2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-comparison-subtext-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtext_size_mobile }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subtext_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-comparison-table-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
  }

  .ai-comparison-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-comparison-column-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.row_padding_mobile }}px 10px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.column_heading_size_mobile }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ai-comparison-column-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-comparison-column-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.left_heading_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.left_heading_text }};
  }

  .ai-comparison-column-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-comparison-column-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.right_heading_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.right_heading_text }};
  }

  .ai-comparison-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.row_padding_mobile }}px 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.comparison_text_size_mobile }}px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    min-height: 60px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-column-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-comparison-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.left_row_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.left_row_text }};
  }

  .ai-comparison-column-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-comparison-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.right_row_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.right_row_text }};
  }

  .ai-comparison-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-right: 6px;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-comparison-icon-check-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.checkmark_color }};
  }

  .ai-comparison-icon-x-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.x_color }};
  }

  .ai-comparison-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: left;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-comparison-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-subtext-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subtext_size_desktop }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-column-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.row_padding_desktop }}px 20px;
      font-size: {{ block.settings.column_heading_size_desktop }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.row_padding_desktop }}px 20px;
      font-size: {{ block.settings.comparison_text_size_desktop }}px;
      min-height: 70px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
      margin-right: 10px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-comparison-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-comparison-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-comparison-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.heading_line1 != blank or block.settings.heading_line2 != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-comparison-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.heading_line1 != blank %}
            <span class="ai-comparison-heading-line1-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_line1 }}</span>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.heading_line2 != blank %}
            <span class="ai-comparison-heading-line2-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_line2 }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </h2>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.subtext != blank %}
        <p class="ai-comparison-subtext-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subtext }}</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-comparison-table-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-comparison-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-comparison-column-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
